<title>UK: Matthew Clark warns on year results.</title>
<headline>Matthew Clark warns on year results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matthew Clark Plc said on Tuesday that its results for the year may suffer due to increased competition in the branded drinks market.</p>
<p>&quot;Whilst it is too early to assess the impact on the full year performance, current estimates indicate (this) will materially affect the results,&quot; the UK drinks company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
